      "id": "io.github.fxrayhughes.mise",
      "name": "mise",
      "author": "FxRayHughes",
      "repository": "https://github.com/FxRayHughes/lithe-plugin-mise",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/FxRayHughes/lithe-plugin-mise#readme",
      "description": "Preview toolchain provider: tells Lithe which JDK, Node.js, Maven, Gradle, Go, Python and pnpm mise installed, and which versions a project's mise.toml or .tool-versions and your global mise config request, so no paths are added by hand. Its backend only runs read-only mise commands (mise ls, mise bin-paths) offline; it never installs or trusts anything. Requires a Lithe preview build with the toolchainProviders capability and mise on your PATH; macOS only.",
      "localizedDescriptions": {
        "zh-Hans": "预发布工具链提供方：告诉 Lithe mise 装了哪些 JDK、Node.js、Maven、Gradle、Go、Python 和 pnpm，以及项目的 mise.toml / .tool-versions 和全局 mise 配置要求哪个版本，无需手动添加路径。后端只以离线方式运行只读的 mise 命令（mise ls、mise bin-paths），不会安装或信任任何东西。需要支持 toolchainProviders 能力的 Lithe preview 开发版，以及 PATH 中可用的 mise，仅支持 macOS。"
      },
