    {
      "id": "io.github.lithe-idea.docker",
      "name": "Docker",
      "author": "Lithe Community",
      "repository": "https://github.com/Lithe-IDEA/lithe-plugin-docker",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/Lithe-IDEA/lithe-plugin-docker#readme",
      "description": "Manage local Docker containers, images, volumes and networks in a tool window, with native container terminals, Compose groups and configuration paths, searchable logs and JSON highlighting, live CPU/memory/network/disk charts with adjustable sampling, and regular-file upload/download. Requires a macOS Lithe host with backend 2, Web UI 2, file dialogs and browser.open. Terminals require API-24 support in a local workspace, Docker CLI on the terminal PATH, and the selected /bin/sh, /bin/bash or /bin/ash shell inside the container. Container file browsing needs /bin/sh and stat -c; transfers are limited to regular files up to 256 MiB. Native terminal, file-dialog and Finder drag-in acceptance is pending; macOS only.",
      "localizedDescriptions": {
        "zh-Hans": "在工具窗口中管理本机 Docker 容器、镜像、卷和网络，支持容器原生终端、Compose 分组及配置路径、日志搜索与 JSON 高亮、可调采样间隔的 CPU/内存/网络/磁盘实时图，以及普通文件上传下载。需要支持 backend 2、Web UI 2、文件对话框和 browser.open 的 macOS Lithe 宿主。终端需要支持 API-24 的本机工作区、终端 PATH 中可用的 Docker CLI，以及容器内所选的 /bin/sh、/bin/bash 或 /bin/ash。容器文件浏览需要 /bin/sh 和 stat -c；单文件传输上限 256 MiB。原生终端、文件对话框与 Finder 拖入验收待完成，仅支持 macOS。"
      },
